@startuml
title Staff Member Class State Machine Diagram

state Unassigned
state AssignedToClient
state AssignedToCampaign
state Unemployed
state Archived

[*] --> LoggedIn

LoggedIn --> Assignable : staff member logged in
Assignable --> AssignedToClient : assign to client
Assignable --> AssignedToCampaign : assign to campaign
AssignedToClient --> Unassigned : remove assignment from client
AssignedToCampaign --> Unassigned : remove assignment from campaign
Unassigned --> LoggedIn : return to login
LoggedIn --> Unemployed : staff member leaves job
Unemployed --> Archived : after some time has passed
Archived --> [*] : end of lifecycle
@enduml
